title: Extracted @a-company/university-core — killed the 3-way pack-loader duplication (v6.6.6)
summary: Extracted the triplicated pack/content-loading logic into one lean shared package, @a-company/university-core (js-yaml + zod, zero @a-company deps). The MCP loader, CLI storage, and serve server now import it; their old copies are re-export shims. Behavior-neutral read path (proven by-construction); the only user delta is CLI search now matching tags. Architect-designed (Option C→A extraction), 3 phased builders + integrated review, end-to-end built-CLI serve smoke verified. This is the long-term cure for the bug class we fixed the same way 3x across v6.6.2–6.6.5.
